GEMINI.md

# Node tooling
# package.json / package-lock.json ARE tracked (load-bearing for sandcastle).
# node_modules/ is regeneratable via `npm install`.
node_modules/

# Local experiment / test artifacts (regeneratable)
.dagster_v6b_test/
.compare_baseline/
exa-results/
# Note: .sandcastle/ itself IS tracked (orchestrator config-as-code).
# Its own .sandcastle/.gitignore excludes secrets (.env), logs/, and worktrees/.

# Throwaway / experimental scripts (underscore-prefixed, ad-hoc)
scripts/_*
